  "comment": {
    "text": "Description under the Private Room title in the room type block of the create-room and edit-room panels (client and SDK). Two sentences: what an end-to-end encrypted private room is for and who can read its files, then that a private room cannot later be made an ordinary room. Use the same words for private room and end-to-end encryption as the other private-room texts.",
    "is_auto": true,
